    <!--Help Screen (English) -->
    <string name="faq_question_rule_1">1. What is the 20-20-20 rule?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_rule_1">Take a break every 20 minutes and look at something in the distance for at least 20 seconds.\n</string>

    <string name="faq_question_rule_2">2. How do I use this app?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_rule_2">Start the timer with your preferred interval.\n\nWhen the signal sounds, look away from the screen and do simple eye exercises:\n• Slowly move your eyes left and right, then up and down.\n• Make circular movements or “figure eights” with your eyes to stretch the eye muscles.\n• Blink frequently to moisturize your eyes and reduce strain.\n\nThe timer will automatically start the next cycle.\n</string>

    <string name="faq_question_rule_3">3. Can I change the timer duration?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_rule_3">Yes, in the settings you can change the screen time duration and the break duration.\nThe timer runs continuously until you stop it manually.\n</string>

    <string name="faq_question_rule_4">4. Can I turn off notification sounds?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_rule_4">Yes, you can disable the sound or choose a different notification sound in the settings.\n</string>

    <string name="faq_question_rule_5">5. Why are notifications not coming?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_rule_5">• Check notification permissions and make sure the app is allowed to send notifications.\n• Make sure the app is not closed in the background.\n• Try restarting the app.\n</string>

    <string name="faq_question_rule_6">6. Does the timer work when the phone is locked?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_rule_6">Yes, the timer continues to run in the background, and notifications will appear on the lock screen.\nYou can also control the timer directly from the notification.\n</string>

    <string name="faq_question_rule_7">7. Why does the timer stop while running in the background?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_rule_7">• Check if power optimization is enabled for this app in your device settings; if it is, disable it.\n• The timer may also stop due to low battery or energy-saving mode.\n</string>


